    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present No. 149 Charlesland Grove to the market.\r\n\r\nThis well-appointed two bedroom, ground floor, own-door apartment is situated in the sought after Charlesland development in Greystones.\r\nA south-facing front aspect fills the home with natural light, while the patio provides a private spot for outdoor seating and is near to a beautifully maintained amenity green, ideal for relaxing or entertaining with friends. There is ample resident and visitor street parking located to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nLocated just a short stroll from the Charlesland Shopping Complex and within easy reach of Greystones town, the DART and a wide array of local amenities, this apartment also offers convenient access to public transport links including bus routes, DART services and the N11 & M50 road networks.\r\n\r\nThis two bedroom apartment extends to 69.3m2 (747 sq.ft) The property offers an entrance hall, open plan living/ dining room, kitchen, inner hallway, 2 bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nGreystones town is within easy reach where all your needs are catered for with a wonderful selection of bistros, boutiques, restaurants and shops, the village library, churches and a large number of highly regarded schools.\r\n\r\nThere are a host of sports and leisure clubs in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA. The Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool is on the doorstep, as are a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\nGreystones is situated in a stunning location between the coast and the Wicklow mountains, with easy access to local beaches, countryside and the nearby villages of Delgany and Enniskerry.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the close proximity to the local bus stops and the DART station, all within walking distance. The N11/ M50 is also within easy commute to the city, airport and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch\r\nSolid wood flooring, gas boiler.\r\n\r\nLiving/ Dining Room\r\nSolid wood flooring, gas inset fire with solid wood mantle, black polished Granite inset and hearth, double doors to patio.\r\n\r\nInner Hallway\r\nCarpeted flooring, hot press off hallway.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nTiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, integrated appliances, stainless steel sink unit, gas hob, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, overlooking cobblelock pathway to the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built-in wardrobe, additional shelving, overlooking to cobble lock pathway to rear. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled flooring, part tiled walls, WC, fully tiled bath with glazed shower door and telephone hand shower, pedestal wash hand basin, chrome heated towel rail, wall hung storage unit, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nSouth-facing patio area, mature hedging and planting, cobble lock paving to the front door, ample on-street resident and visitor parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Own door ground floor apartment\r\nAmple off-street parking\r\nSouth-facing orientation\r\nWell-presented throughout\r\nDouble glazed windows and doors to the rear\r\nNew composite front door and double glazed windows to the front of the property\r\nEnviable B BER rating\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nBroadband available\r\nVacant possession\r\nClose to the amenity green\r\nCharlesland Shopping Complex is within walking distance\r\nPublic bus service and the DART is within close proximity"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
